── apptainer --bind examples (not run) ──
$ apptainer exec --bind "$PWD":/work scitex-agent-container.sif python -V
$ apptainer exec --bind "$HOME":"$HOME":ro scitex-agent-container.sif ...

── sac equivalent (spec.yaml fragment, same for both runtimes) ──
spec:
  runtime: apptainer
  mounts:
    - src: ${HOME}
      dst: ${HOME}
      mode: rw
    - src: /scratch/${USER}
      dst: /scratch/${USER}
      mode: rw
